{"last_link_id": 20, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [304.7111511230469, 508.1291809082031], "pos": [820, -632.7262573242188], "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]\n你靠在窗前\n咖啡还冒着白色的烟\n说世界太喧嚣\n却又悄悄期待明天\n\n我递给你围巾\n把你的手藏进我手里面\n风吹乱你刘海\n却吹不散这一瞬间\n\n[Chorus]\n等到春天来 花会替我告白\n把所有没说完的勇敢 盛开在你窗台\n就算路还长 夜再多阴霾\n有你在 我就有答案\n一步一步 走向未来\n\n[Verse 2]\n你笑说你害怕\n害怕有天我们走散开\n我说那就紧一点\n把彼此的影子拴在口袋\n\n雨落在屋檐\n像一首轻轻哼着的歌\n你靠在我肩上\n我听见你的心在和声着\n\n[Chorus]\n等到春天来 花会替我告白\n把所有没说完的勇敢 盛开在你窗台\n就算路还长 夜再多阴霾\n有你在 我就有答案\n一步一步 走向未来\n\n[Bridge]\n如果有一天 你不再相信自己\n就回头看看 这一路走过的痕迹\n每个平凡清晨 每个拥抱的夜里\n都是我们写给明天的秘密\n\n[Chorus]\n等到春天来 世界为你盛开\n把所有受过的伤感 慢慢变成光彩\n就算风再大 也吹不走期待\n有你在 梦就有形态\n一步一步 走向未来"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 13, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [6], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-130, -470], "widgets_values": ["流星下的誓言\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "JjkText", "title": "title：歌曲标题（相当于歌名）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [338.293212890625, 112], "pos": [820, -980], "widgets_values": ["audio1/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 1, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_